# Cryogen Relic draws a card as it enters and another as it leaves. Bot2 taps its Llanowar Elves for mana on turn 4, so the
# Elves are still tapped on Bot1's turn 5: Bot1 sacrifices the Relic ({1}{U}) to put a stun counter on them, and draws
# again as it leaves. Bot1 starts with seven cards, draws for turns 3 and 5 and for each of the Relic's two triggers.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Cryogen Relic
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest
Forest x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cryogen Relic.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Activate
? Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Tapped = True
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Cryogen Relic.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Counters.Stun = 1

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Counters.Stun = 1
Bot1.Graveyard = Cryogen Relic
